  "ingredients": [
    "1 (3 ounce) package lemon flavored Jell-O® mix",
    "1 (3 ounce) package lime flavored Jell-O® mix",
    "4 cups boiling water",
    "1 tablespoon apple cider vinegar",
    "2 stalks celery, finely chopped",
    "0.5 cup chopped pimento-stuffed green olives",
    "2 carrots, peeled and grated"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OX69xjQDTRtd_psHjluGtECceE8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/140514-lemon-lime-vegetable-salad-DDMFS-28074-step-01-61ea908a84d744328f89e5e4160c5879.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140514/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, stir together the lemon gelatin mix, lime gelatin mix, and boiling water until gelatin has dissolved. Stir in the apple cider vinegar, cover, and refrigerate for about 1 hour to thicken.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cCVXYRaqOAqxsX05D3PJzoSwJgA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/140514-lemon-lime-vegetable-salad-DDMFS-28076-step-02-aa72678668914b5aa04e4a75928a6da4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140514/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the gelatin is thick but not set, stir in the celery, olives, and carrot so they are evenly dispersed throughout.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DKDQkUB17wddvFKqdhRpgvNE-L0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/140514-lemon-lime-vegetable-salad-DDMFS-28111-step-03-5685db759459491fa1cc599c7e501479.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140514/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into a 1 quart mold and refrigerate until firm, at least 3 hours. To serve, unmold onto a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WbZB-ibQXR4_jxS9l6Jqf5qcuUg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/140514-lemon-lime-vegetable-salad-DDMFS-28234-step-04-4658c68ae65c4affab4588414bba7b39.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140514/step_04.webp"
    }
